
## Your relay's nickname (letters and numbers only, max 19 chars)
Nickname MyPiRelay

## Ports
ORPort 9001
DirPort 9030

## Safety settings — non-negotiable
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
SocksPort 0

## Contact information (HIGHLY recommended)
ContactInfo YourName <your@email.com>

## Bandwidth: Start conservative
BandwidthRate 2 MB
BandwidthBurst 4 MB

## Optional: Monthly data cap
# AccountingMax 100 GB
# AccountingStart month 1 00:00

## Logging
Log notice file /var/log/tor/notices.log

## Data directory
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor